    "title": "Feather River pile burns cover 60 acres, expect smoke impacts - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ellie Marty ,\n2 hours ago LA PORTE, Calif. - Firefighters successfully burned piles across 60 acres in the Feather River Ranger District on Wednesday. According to the Forest Service, the burning took place at five locations along La Porte Road and at Little Grass Valley Reservoir Recreation Area. They treated an additional two acres near American House and five acres near Wyandotte Campground. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
